     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Strains resistant to β-lactams, vanco or aminoglycosides: test suscep to daptomycin and linezolid."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
